{
  "name": "Mano Ya - Reportes",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "reportes",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Webhook Reportes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -820,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000a1",
      "notes": "Punto de entrada para el trigger reports_notify_n8n de Supabase. La app Flutter solo inserta en public.reports; no llama a este webhook ni a notify-report. URL final: https://<TU-N8N>/webhook/reportes"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "categoria-01",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.categoria || $json.body.reporte?.categoria || '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "motivo-02",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.motivo || $json.body.reporte?.motivo || '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "correo-03",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.correo || $json.body.reporte?.correo || $json.body.reporter_email || $json.body.reporte?.reporter_email || '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Validar Reporte",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -580,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Exige categoria, motivo y correo del reportante. Si falta alguno, el flujo responde con ok=false sin llamar a la Edge Function."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1/reports",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "select",
              "value": "id"
            },
            {
              "name": "id",
              "value": "={{ 'eq.' + ($('Webhook Reportes').first().json.body.id || '') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "limit",
              "value": "1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "{{SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer {{SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Consultar reporte en Supabase",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -340,
        0
      ],
      "disabled": true,
      "onError": "continue",
      "notes": "NODO OPCIONAL, desactivado por defecto. Consulta el reporte en la tabla public.reports usando la service role key. Sirve para endurecer el webhook (comprobar que el reporte existe de verdad antes de avisar a soporte). Para activarlo: 1) sustituye {{SUPABASE_URL}} y {{SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY}}, 2) activa el nodo y 3) anade un nodo IF que compruebe que la respuesta trae una fila (por ejemplo {{ $json.length }} > 0) para decidir si se envia el correo."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/functions/v1/notify-report",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "x-webhook-secret",
              "value": "{{N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ reporte: $('Webhook Reportes').first().json.body }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000
        }
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Enviar correo (Edge Function)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -100,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continue",
      "retryOnFail": false,
      "notes": "Llama a la Edge Function notify-report de Supabase, que envia el correo con Resend. Sustituye los marcadores {{SUPABASE_URL}} y {{N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET}} por los valores reales (o por expresiones $vars)."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "sheetId": "{{GOOGLE_SHEETS_ID}}",
        "sheetName": "Reportes",
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
